    <item>
      <title>Squeak 2.23.22</title>
      <pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 09:11:30 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>22322</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.23.22</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><style>html{color-scheme:light dark}body{font:13px/1.5 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'SF Pro Text',system-ui,sans-serif;color:#18181b;background:transparent;margin:0;padding:4px 2px}ul{margin:0 0 10px;padding-left:18px}li{margin:0 0 6px}p{margin:0 0 10px}h4{font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:#52525b;margin:16px 0 6px;padding-top:10px;border-top:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.08)}code{font:12px ui-monospace,'SF Mono',monospace;background:rgba(0,0,0,.06);padding:1px 4px;border-radius:6px}@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){body{color:#f4f4f5}h4{color:#a1a1aa;border-top-color:rgba(255,255,255,.12)}code{background:rgba(255,255,255,.1)}}</style></head><body><ul><li>Full screen has no bar at all: move to the top and the window controls slide in beside the sidebar arrows.</li></ul><h4>Also in 2.23.21</h4><ul><li>Updates install themselves: they download in the background and you just restart.</li><li>Check for updates takes you to where you are: Settings if it's open, otherwise the sidebar card.</li><li>Sign out always works, even if a sign-in window was left open.</li><li>A sign-in or connect that never finishes stops after five minutes, and a Cancel link sits beside it.</li><li>Settings › Account no longer opens a second browser sign-in on its own: it asks once per launch, and when it needs you the button says "Finish connecting to Squeak's cloud".</li></ul><h4>Also in 2.23.20</h4><ul><li>Full screen no longer shows an empty band at the top.</li></ul></body></html>]]></description>
